  "design": {
    "idea": "Freeze Dew Lens #1 via a rotated Blue Transformer into a 3-way Blue Prism Splitter that simultaneously frost-pins the chasm bridge for 12 s and trips the east blue eye, then roll Dew Lens #2 liquid-side to burn the root-knot guarding Key #1.",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "Using both states of dew_lens in one chamber: frozen 3-way Blue Prism Splitter for frost-pinning + eye activation, and liquid focused dew_ray to burn dry_root_knot.",
